  "question": {
    "text": "If function <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mtable><mtr><mtd><mi>a</mi><msqrt><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn></msqrt></mtd><mtd><mo>;</mo></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>b</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>;</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mfenced></math> is differentiable <math><mo>∀</mo><mi></mi><mi>x</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, then <math><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>b</mi></math> is equal to"
